WEBVTT

00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:18.360
I hope it'll come true this year.

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:55.000
Good morning, Amami!

00:01:55.990 --> 00:01:57.890
Ogawa, Inoue.

00:01:58.210 --> 00:01:59.750
Good morning!

00:02:00.610 --> 00:02:01.770
Morning.

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:06.480
I-Is something wrong?

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:11.900
No, you just seem even more cheerful than usual.

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:15.570
Y-You could tell?

00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:18.680
Of course you'd notice, Inoue.

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:19.700
What does that mean?

00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:21.640
Um...

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:24.200
The Star Festival is this weekend.

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:28.750
And, well... I've been waiting so long for it...

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:32.460
I-I just have no idea how I'm supposed to react!

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:39.510
<i>Was the Star Festival always such a big deal?</i>

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:44.470
But I don't remember you acting like this last year.

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:46.110
Well...

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:49.980
Excuse me.

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:53.110
Yes? Is something wrong?

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:55.800
You never change, Inoue.

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:57.190
Shut up!

00:02:57.980 --> 00:02:59.280
<i>That's right...</i>

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:04.540
<i>It's already been over a year since I met her.</i>

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:08.970
Amami!

00:03:08.970 --> 00:03:11.960
But I still can't handle that stuff!

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:15.800
Star Festival decorations?

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:17.050
Yes!

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:21.840
I hang my mother's handmade decorations
at home for the Star Festival every year.

00:03:22.530 --> 00:03:28.350
Last year, I couldn't find them because
they were still packed up from the move.

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:42.780
But then, the other day,
my dad stumbled over them.

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:46.030
<i>I can just picture it...</i>

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:48.450
No wonder you're in such a good mood.

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:53.910
So they're your mom's original creations?

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:56.720
I bet they're pretty wild.

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:58.670
Legit occult stuff.

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:02.070
I kinda want to see
what they're like, though.

00:04:02.070 --> 00:04:02.550
Me too.

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:05.650
Well, if you'd like,

00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:07.930
why don't you all come over this weekend?

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:09.770
Can we?

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:13.520
Yes! I'm sure my mother would be thrilled.

00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:15.100
Heck yeah!

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:16.480
Count me in!

00:04:17.010 --> 00:04:18.690
The Star Festival, huh...

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:23.240
So, what are you all going to wish for?

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:27.480
More allowance... I guess?

00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:28.760
I can get behind that!

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:30.750
Then I'll wish for...

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:31.990
Total annihilation, again!

00:04:31.990 --> 00:04:33.170
Stop it!

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:35.960
What should I wish for?

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:37.990
To stop being so difficult.

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:39.090
It's already decided?!

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:44.300
I-I think you're great
just the way you are, Inoue.

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:48.680
I'm not gonna make a wish like that, you jerk!

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:53.620
Still, we're talking about decorations
hand-crafted by Amami's mom!

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:58.060
Maybe they have some mysterious power
to make our wishes really come true!

00:04:58.520 --> 00:04:59.730
They <i>will</i> come true.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:02.860
No way!

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:05.020
It's true.

00:05:05.020 --> 00:05:09.370
My family's wishes have come true every year.

00:05:10.130 --> 00:05:12.200
Seriously? I'm jealous—

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:15.750
Then I wish to take the best ghost photo ever!

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:18.380
I'm sure you will.

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:22.010
Then how about if I wish for him to be my friend?

00:05:22.010 --> 00:05:24.220
F-Fictional things don't count...

00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:36.670
How pretty.

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:38.760
They're really something.

00:05:38.760 --> 00:05:41.070
They're as elegant as I'd imagined.

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:43.780
Everyone, the tea is ready.

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:47.620
Aren't these the eggs you cooked before?

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:51.160
I hope they're to your liking.

00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:58.500
These fried eggs are really sweet and delicious!

00:05:59.490 --> 00:06:01.170
I feel re-energized.

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:03.880
But yeah, they're really good.

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:08.090
What are you, a hamster?

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:11.490
I'm so glad you like them.

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:13.500
They're actually...

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:16.600
They're very special to me...

00:06:19.110 --> 00:06:21.420
Okay, we've had our break.

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:24.340
Let's get to the main event and write our wishes!

00:06:24.340 --> 00:06:27.610
Okay, I'll write the first one!

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:29.450
Hey, no fair!

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:30.280
Done.

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:36.330
You doofus.

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:40.000
No! My manly dream...

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:43.890
In a weird way, it actually has come true...

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:46.840
Although there's no "giddy" or "lovely" about it.

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:50.880
I wonder if wishes for other people would work.

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:52.290
What do you mean?

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:53.530
Well...

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:59.100
I was thinking, if I do this,
would they become real couples?

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:11.700
Their anger manifested in the physical world?!

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:13.990
I-I-I'm sorry...

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:17.310
I had no idea it'd offend you so much...

00:07:17.310 --> 00:07:20.380
Well, they're like cats and dogs.

00:07:20.380 --> 00:07:26.300
But if the wishes really do come true,
then you could pull pranks like that.

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:32.220
Whose name do you think
you're writing, huh?

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:36.270
Well, whose and whose, indeed?

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:44.020
Already using those to harass me, are you?!

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:46.320
You're both so gloomy.
It's a perfect match.

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:47.150
What?!

00:07:49.430 --> 00:07:52.810
They're such good friends
that they can have fights... I guess?

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:56.680
Now's my chance.

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:01.280
I have only one wish.

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:04.380
Panty shots all year 'round!

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:12.370
Who needs cat paws?

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:13.470
Kitty...

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:17.140
Now that I think about it,
I'm not sure what to write.

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:21.000
Most of it is stuff I could do myself if I really tried.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:23.510
Money, grades...

00:08:23.510 --> 00:08:25.470
Annihilation...

00:08:25.470 --> 00:08:26.730
Run for it, Bro!

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:27.450
What about you, Amami?

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:28.450
Bro!

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:29.130
Huh?

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:32.000
What wish did you write?

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:35.650
O-Oh, it's just a boring, normal wish!

00:08:35.650 --> 00:08:38.160
Doesn't look normal to me.

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:40.210
B-But...

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:41.430
Well...

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:47.460
Here.

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:50.670
It's terribly embarrassing, but...

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:53.480
Ever since I was little,

00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:57.050
I haven't had many friends who weren't ghosts...

00:08:57.360 --> 00:09:00.040
Well, then, you don't need
to hang this up anymore.

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:06.710
C'mon, people, write down your wishes.

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:09.220
And you know, wishing for your
families' health and safety is fine.

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:10.290
Yeah, yeah...

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:15.000
Then I'll wish for him to move again!

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:17.240
I'm not giving up on my harem!

00:09:18.090 --> 00:09:21.120
Panties, panties, panties...

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:26.250
What have we here?!
There's one more left!

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:33.640
Aren't you gonna hang that one, too?

00:09:40.040 --> 00:09:41.390
There's no need.

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:43.850
I'm happy enough right now.

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:48.980
Wishing for this on top of it would be too selfish.

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:52.990
You too! Hurry up!

00:09:53.950 --> 00:09:55.240
Coming!

00:10:09.220 --> 00:10:11.340
She wants to see her mother...

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:14.580
A perfectly natural wish for a child.

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:19.030
For Lady Amami to consider
such a natural thing selfish...

00:10:19.030 --> 00:10:20.640
It pulls at the heartstrings!

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:25.720
How long has she kept that ratty old paper?

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:28.790
Hibby's such a packrat.

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:31.650
She'll butt into other people's
business with their moms,

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:33.340
but never say a word about her own?

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:35.030
Gag me with a spoon, seriously.

00:10:35.590 --> 00:10:38.390
Why do you suppose Lady Yuuhi

00:10:38.390 --> 00:10:42.680
has never returned to visit
Lady Amami, even once?

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:46.500
It's possible that she is not capable of coming to her.

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:50.210
She may be bound to one spot, like me...

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:51.130
Bound...

00:10:51.770 --> 00:10:55.590
Hey, remember how I possessed
Hibby that one time?

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:57.170
When I did...

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:03.350
I saw something.

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:04.720
Saw what?

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:06.150
Dunno.

00:11:06.150 --> 00:11:09.980
But it was warm, and kind...

00:11:10.620 --> 00:11:18.610
Kinda like...

00:11:20.270 --> 00:11:22.570
What are you looking at, cue-ball samurai?!

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:24.830
You're so irrational!

00:11:25.350 --> 00:11:27.700
Anyway, it made me wonder

00:11:28.150 --> 00:11:30.870
if that was Hibby's mom.

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:32.250
Oh, my!

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:35.500
Wait, but if it was, then why...

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:37.870
But what if it <i>was</i> her?

00:11:37.870 --> 00:11:39.350
Stop.

00:11:39.350 --> 00:11:40.680
I haven't said anything yet.

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:43.430
We are, by nature,

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:46.430
incompatible with the living.

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:51.440
Should we come in contact with the strong,
brilliant, profound life energy of the living,

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:55.500
there's no telling what will happen.

00:11:56.320 --> 00:12:01.360
What kinda gal would I be if I actually
listened when I got lectured?

00:12:01.930 --> 00:12:03.820
You're sure about this?

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:06.240
Don't sell me short.

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:09.750
I just want to return the favor.

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:17.960
This must be what they mean by "difficult."

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:19.870
Lady Amami, forgive me!

00:12:35.860 --> 00:12:39.110
Are these... Hibby's memories?

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:47.050
This must be Lady Amami before she met us.

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:50.000
She hasn't changed a bit.

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:51.120
That was...

00:12:53.050 --> 00:12:54.960
I see it! Over there!

00:12:58.690 --> 00:13:02.100
It's so warm...

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:15.720
What are these?

00:13:16.950 --> 00:13:18.160
Morning glories?

00:13:19.210 --> 00:13:20.730
Forget the flowers!

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:26.130
I apologize for the intrusion.

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:27.780
Would you happen to be...

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:36.670
Come right in!

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:43.120
I'm Yuuhi, Hibiki's mother.

00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:48.140
I'm so happy I get to meet her friends!

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:50.820
You're the roll-call samurai, yes?

00:13:50.820 --> 00:13:53.930
Thank you for always watching over Hibiki!

00:13:57.190 --> 00:13:59.440
But you're so thin.

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:01.000
You shouldn't be picky.

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:03.940
Eat all of your offerings, not just the Noritama!

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:05.250
Got that?

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:07.280
U-Understood!

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:10.740
Oh, what an adorable girl!

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:15.000
I remember that look being in style back in my day.

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:17.570
I always wanted to dress like that,

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:19.630
but my mom wouldn't let me.

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:21.470
Isn't that unfair?

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:27.430
Um, I think traditional Japanese clothing
looks much better on you... ma'am.

00:14:28.540 --> 00:14:29.890
You're such a kind girl.

00:14:31.450 --> 00:14:33.650
Can I touch your loose socks?

00:14:33.650 --> 00:14:34.270
Huh?

00:14:34.270 --> 00:14:36.270
They're so long!

00:14:37.620 --> 00:14:39.760
Hey—What are you doing?!

00:14:39.760 --> 00:14:42.400
We didn't come here to play around!

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:47.310
I-If you're so close by,
why don't you ever visit Hibby?

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:52.530
Lady Amami wishes to meet her mother, even now.

00:14:54.880 --> 00:14:56.040
Go and see her!

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:59.380
It's been her wish forever!

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:02.420
I know.

00:15:03.310 --> 00:15:07.180
I've watched over her
from right here her whole life.

00:15:07.940 --> 00:15:09.640
Then why?!

00:15:25.970 --> 00:15:26.900
Lady Yuuhi?

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:30.840
Because...

00:15:33.440 --> 00:15:37.600
If I don't stay here and protect her...

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:43.480
Our dear, precious...

00:15:44.530 --> 00:15:47.300
Precious what?

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:50.720
That doesn't matter!

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:54.390
Don't you want to see Hibby?

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:56.430
Don't you care about her?!

00:15:56.970 --> 00:16:01.140
Isn't a mom always supposed
to treasure her daughter,

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:03.480
even if she's a bratty idiot like me?!

00:16:03.820 --> 00:16:04.880
You...

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:10.100
That...

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:14.700
That holds true for any mother, of course.

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:19.400
I do want to see her.

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:21.210
Desperately.

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:30.750
After all, I never had a chance to hold Hibiki, not even once.

00:16:33.240 --> 00:16:34.610
But I can't.

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:39.890
If I don't keep this place
filled with my powers...

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:42.480
What about temporarily?

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:49.020
What if I temporarily remained here in your stead?

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:52.990
Couldn't you meet Lady Amami then?

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:54.500
I-I'll stay too!

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:59.240
I appreciate it, but it won't work.

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:02.170
The two of you alone won't be enough...

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:03.740
Then...

00:17:04.890 --> 00:17:06.950
How about them?

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.680
What are you all doing here?

00:17:17.020 --> 00:17:19.600
There are busybodies everywhere, you know.

00:17:19.940 --> 00:17:24.850
You two never listen to your
own words anyway, he said.

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:29.110
It was tough for me, but I made it here too.

00:17:29.510 --> 00:17:34.550
Seriously, don't any of you busybodies
have anything better to do?

00:17:34.550 --> 00:17:36.990
We're extremely grateful to you all.

00:17:37.400 --> 00:17:40.770
She doesn't need any rain in her heart.

00:17:40.770 --> 00:17:44.790
If it'll make Amami happy,
then it makes me happy, too!

00:17:45.180 --> 00:17:49.420
And it's no fun peeking at her panties
if she's too sad to put up a fight.

00:17:49.910 --> 00:17:54.630
She always takes the time to play with me.

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:01.640
Even with...

00:18:02.170 --> 00:18:06.940
Even with my powers,
the burden of protecting these is not light.

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:14.950
It will be a great burden to you all.
There's no telling what will happen.

00:18:15.450 --> 00:18:17.530
Regardless, we'll do it.

00:18:18.080 --> 00:18:19.030
Samurai...

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:23.620
Lady Amami has lifted my heart,
and if it is for her sake,

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:25.900
then there is nothing to fear.

00:18:25.900 --> 00:18:27.460
You heard the man.

00:18:30.520 --> 00:18:31.720
<i>Hibiki...</i>

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:36.190
<i>So these are your...</i>

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:41.420
Thank you.

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:57.320
Hibiki...

00:18:59.420 --> 00:19:00.950
What is it?

00:19:01.440 --> 00:19:02.450
Hibiki.

00:19:11.970 --> 00:19:14.050
Mom...

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:20.210
Um... Uh...

00:19:20.690 --> 00:19:22.050
I-It's nice to meet you!

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:28.840
I've seen you so many times in pictures, but, um...

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:33.020
You've grown so much.

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:35.880
Yes!

00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:41.070
Dad has raised me very well.

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:50.830
I'm sorry... I know you've wished
for this for a long time...

00:19:52.100 --> 00:19:54.170
I-It's all right!

00:19:54.170 --> 00:20:01.340
I-I've got Dad, and all the ghosts,
and my... f-friends...

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:05.850
Hibiki.

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:12.900
May I hold you?

00:20:26.890 --> 00:20:28.190
Mom...

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:52.730
Yuuhi...

00:21:20.720 --> 00:21:21.630
Mom?!

00:21:30.740 --> 00:21:33.520
It wasn't a dream.

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:36.800
That's right!

00:21:36.800 --> 00:21:38.860
Mom told me what happened.

00:21:39.420 --> 00:21:42.030
Roll-call Samurai, Gal!

00:21:43.890 --> 00:21:46.280
And, um... Everyone else!

00:21:54.340 --> 00:21:55.080
Anyone!

00:21:55.600 --> 00:22:00.340
If any of you can hear me, please come out!

00:22:00.820 --> 00:22:02.960
Speak to me!

00:22:04.860 --> 00:22:06.470
Please!

00:22:06.850 --> 00:22:08.400
Please...

00:23:41.280 --> 00:23:45.620
It's been so peaceful around here
since Amami lost her sixth sense!

00:23:45.620 --> 00:23:49.900
Or so I thought at first.
But why does it feel so unbearable?

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:53.070
To be honest, I'm still terrified of ghosts,

00:23:53.070 --> 00:23:55.830
and I'm still a little scared of Amami's power.

00:23:56.240 --> 00:23:58.830
But seeing her like this...

